---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="pt-24 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">About Us</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          We're passionate about connecting people with great content and building a community around shared interests.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Our Mission</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            To provide a platform where people can discover, share, and discuss their favorite content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">👥</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Our Community</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            A diverse group of enthusiasts sharing their passion and knowledge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💡</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Our Vision</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            To become the leading platform for content discovery and community engagement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Our Story</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
            Founded in 2024, we started with a simple idea: create a space where people could easily find and share their favorite content. Since then, we've grown into a thriving community of users who are passionate about movies, series, and books.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Our platform continues to evolve based on user feedback and changing needs, always staying true to our core mission of connecting people through content they love.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>